:: Casey Introduction
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
You walk up to them and introduce yourself. They blow another puff of smoke and take a glance your way. “Now you look nice and all, but I'm not looking for a chat, so beat it.” They make a shooing motion with their hand and put the cigar back into their mouth with the other.
<br><br>
<<link [[Persist|Casey Again]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Listen and leave|Connudatus Street]]>><<set $caseyagain to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Casey Again
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
They blow another puff of smoke and take a glance your way. “Didn’t I tell you to leave me alone? Look, I’m not looking for company, just scram.” You slide closer to them. “Fine. If I tell you my name, will you leave me alone?” <<He>> doesn’t wait for an answer. “It’s Casey. Now can you leave?” <<He>> says as <<he>> turns you around and pushes you away.
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Connudatus Street]]>><<set $caseymet to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

