:: Casey Ride Home
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
"Hey, I was waiting for you. 
<<if $caseyridefirst is 0>>
Check out this baby," <<He>> says, patting <<his>> motorcycle. "Custom made, I built it out of parts I found in the landfill. It took a while to put together and get working, but she's a beauty, isn't she? Of course she has nothing on you, though. <<He>> lets out a small laugh.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> hops on the motorcycle and offers you a hand. You take <<his>> hand and climb on behind <<him>>. "Make sure to hold on tight. You don't want to fall off," <<He>> says as the engine fires and you start to move. 
<br><br><<takeHandholdingVirginity "Casey" "romantic">>
<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
You hold on loosely, enjoying the breeze. <<He>> smiles as he can tell you're having a good time.
<<else>>
You wrap your arms around <<him>> tightly. <<He>> starts to blush and says, "Is everything alright back there?" You nod and continue to hold <<him>>. 
<</if>>
<br><br>
You arrive home and dismount the bike. "I hope you enjoyed the ride." Casey says, smiling.

<br><br>
<<link [[Say Goodbye|Bye Motor]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $promiscuity gte 15>>
<<link [[Kiss Goodbye|Kiss Motor]]>><</link>><<kissvirginitywarning>>
<</if>>

