:: Casey Hello
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
"Oh hey, didn't expect to see you here; the lock to get in is quite hard to pick." Casey grins and flashes <<his>> lockpick. "Of course it's nothing to me. I'm just digging for some scrap to build with. You might not know, but I'm pretty handy with this stuff."
<br><br>
<<link [[Help Scavenge (1:00)|Help Scavenge]]>><<pass 60>><<set $rng to random(1,100)>><<npcincr Casey love 3>><</link>><<ggglove>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Trash]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Help Scavenge
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
"Wait, really? I didn't take you for the type to do that. I appreciate the help," <<he>> says as <<he>> continues to dig. 
<br><br>
<<if $rng is 1>>
You start scrounging through a scrap pile and find a seemingly intact nice-looking motor. "Wow, this is an incredible find." Casey runs over and gives it a touch. "Extremely nice condition; this is the best thing I could have asked for." <<He>> gives you a hug. "I'm going to bring this home and get to work.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Trash]]>><<npcincr Casey love 10>><<set $motorupgrade to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
