:: Casey Money
<<npc Casey>><<person1>>
<<if $caseystayover is undefined>>
    "Money?" Casey looks toward you with a confused look in <<his>> eyes. "Are you struggling with money? What's the matter?"
    <br><br>
    You spend some time talking to Casey about Bailey's exorbitant rent payments. You can see a glint in Casey's eyes as <<he>> silently listens. <<He>> stands up with <<his>> fist clenched and speaks with a tone you haven't heard from <<him>> often, if at all. "That bastard, how dare <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> treat you like that? You've done nothing to deserve the abuse that monster gives you."
    <br><br>
    Casey lets out a heavy sigh, trying to calm <<himself>>. "It might not look like much but... you're welcome to stay here as long as you like. At the very least, I will do what I can to keep you safe as long as you are here."
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Next|Casey Flat]]>><<set $caseystayover to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
    "You need some money? Alright let me see..." Casey opens <<his>> leather wallet from the nightstand and looks inside. "I have about £<<print $caseymoney * 100>>" <<He>> takes the money from the wallet and hands it all to you. "Here, you need it more than I do."
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Next|Casey Flat]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

